## AgriciDaniel/claude-ads:ads

A substantive specialist operating suite. The conductor routes to authored native sub-skills and deterministic schema/scoring/rendering runtime. Experiments require declared power/duration assumptions, pre-registration, assignment integrity and uncertainty; budgets include gross margin and cash constraints. Optional live writes require capability, approval, ceiling, idempotency, verification and rollback gates.

Limits: Conditional native suite, not a lightweight single-file drop-in. Host/runtime compatibility and live platform capability are unverified. Archived dependency manifests are source evidence, not installed wheels. No claims of security testing or operational readiness. Platform source-ledger dates must be refreshed by the authored workflow before any current platform claim. The 33 bundled workflow/platform SKILL.md files are dependent suite resources, not 33 separately recommended or individually usage-verified skills. The experiment component is a short methodological workflow, not a bundled verified statistical-inference engine. Required calculations, power, intervals and multiplicity handling depend on the eventual host/tool implementation and have not been executed. An ordinary skills.sh single-skill installation of ads is not evidence that the other 33 skills, runtime, schemas and native plugin resources are installed. Follow the preserved original suite installation contract.

## Rejections

- Corey ab-testing: Substantive statistical interpretation error: describes p<0.05 as less than 5% chance the result is random. Reject unchanged; no corrective wrapper.
- Phuryn ab-test-analysis: Sample-size formula omits the power term despite claiming an 80% power validation. Reject unchanged for rigorous experiment inference.
- Corey ads: Useful native audit gates, but mandatory payback reference makes cash/break-even recommendations from CAC/ARPU and CAC/(ARPU × annual retention) without margin or proper survival cash-flow treatment. Prefer specialist Claude Ads original.
- Corey revops: Useful lifecycle methods, but this group does not select it for rigorous diagnostic coverage: dashboard win-rate denominator says total opportunities rather than explicitly closed outcomes. No source correction made.
- Alireza partnerships-architect: Only 306 displayed individual installs; repository popularity alone does not justify promoting it over directly relevant co-marketing at 66.4K. Not claimed to fill strategic-alliance gaps.
- Alireza channel-economics: Only 303 displayed individual installs. Not adopted as the financially rigorous specialist needed for alliance P&L.
- arnabbagxd brand-partnerships: Fresh page displays 1.2K individual installs, materially lower adoption and no necessary additional role capability beyond selected co-marketing; not selected or licence-approved.
- Anthropic internal-comms: High adoption (74.1K) but internal-company communications is not a sound substitute for Noor’s external crisis/press function; omitted from compact kit.
